<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-crwt4c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-crwt4c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FCRWT4C>.
