<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1wmwnm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2F1WMWNM>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1wmwnm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Supplemental data to: \\'ab-initio molecular dynamics of the solvation of manganese ions\\'".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1wmwnm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Supplemental data for the Master\\'s thesis \\'Ab-initio Molecular Dynamics of the Solvation of Manganese Ions\\'. Files are named after the corresponding simulation in the thesis. Filetypes .radial: radial distribution functions and coordination number; atom types are indicated by the file name (Mn: manganese, O: oxygen, H: hydrogen) .angle: angular probability distribution; atom types are indicated by the file name (Mn: manganese, O: oxygen, H: hydrogen) .hbonds_c: average number of hydrogen bonds per molecule; some files only count hydrogen bonds for a selected number of oxygen atoms indicated by NAMES in the file\\'s header .xyz: final atomic configurations in the unit cell .mp4: videos illustrating dynamics processes For more detailed information please consult the thesis or the paw_structure Python package mentioned therein.".
