<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rtfpmu> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rtfpmu> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FRTFPMU>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rtfpmu> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data - null objects in medieval romance".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rtfpmu> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset compiles the collected data from various corpus studies on null and overt objects in medieval French and medieval Italian. The bilingual data (French - Italian) is accompanied by English annotations on a number of variables (animacy, specificity, person, number, gender, as well as context variables).".
