<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-omxq0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FOMXQ0E>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-omxq0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Experiment e42".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-omxq0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Indentation simulations, where microspheres are pressed into layers of statically cross-linked actin networks. In contrast to dynamic cross-links in E41, the static cross-links used here are fixed, they can not bind or unbind. Final states of cross-linked networks of E38 served as initial states.".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-omxq0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-omxq0e".
