<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-juqk7n> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Georoc compilation: seamounts".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-juqk7n> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Compilation of geochemical and isotopic rock compositions from seamounts held in the GEOROC database. Results are grouped by geographical provinces. Files were generated from the GEOROC database on 2026-06-01.".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-juqk7n> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-juqk7n".
