<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FRCFQCG>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: a computational bird\\'s eye view of redox reactivity in the formation of cysteine-lysine covalent linkages".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The results obtained for the manuscript are available, divided in three folders: -Mechanism: the qm calculations for the NOS formation mechanism -Reduction_potentials: the qm calculations for the discussed reduction potentials. -SI: qm calculations for the evaluation of the employed theoretical approach (shown in the supporting information)".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-rcfqcg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
