<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-dyg3kv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Contains recordings and manual annotations of calls from pairs of male and female marmosets. Manual annotations were created by the original authors and manually corrected for training and testing DAS. Original data source for the recordings and the annotations: https://osf.io/q4bm3/ Original reference: Landman R, Sharma J, Hyman JB, Fanucci-Kiss A, Meisner O, Parmar S, Feng G, Desimone R. 2020. Close-range vocal interaction in the common marmoset (Callithrix jacchus). PLOS ONE 15:e0227392. doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0227392".
