<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FW9PWCX>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Pathway maps for metagenome-assembled genome sequences from marsberg kilianstollen".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Pathways maps of the MAGs that were classified as members of Actinobacteria (Mberg 009), “Candidatus Binatota” (Mberg 010 and 011), Chlorobacteria (Mberg 002, 006, 008, and 019), and Deinococcus-Thermus (Mberg 015). Chloroflexota-Mberg002, Dehalococcoidia-Mberg008, Chloroflexia-Mber006 and Ktedonobacteria-Mberg019".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/goettingen>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625/W9PWCX>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:goe-doi-10-25625-w9pwcx.
