<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1emffl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the data and analysis scripts to for the publication \\'Table-top three-dimensional photoemission orbital tomography with a femtosecond extreme ultraviolet light source\\'.".
