<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jyfh3y> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "B08 - community matrices (species-level) of soil animals (core plots, 2013)".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jyfh3y> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Species-level identified soil animal taxa from 32 core plots from the first EFForTS phase (mostly 2013). Samples were collected from litter and soil and extracted using a Kempson extractor. The following taxonomic groups were identified to species level and are shared in this dataset: Oribatida, Mesostigmata, Collembola, Pseudoscorpiones, Chilopoda, Carabidae, Araneae (hear extraction), Araneae (litter sieving, B01 data). Morphospecies can be found in Ecotaxonomy web database.".
