<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mvznnc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Results data set of the economic laboratory experiment about “algorithm aversion vs. loss aversion” as conducted in ostfalia laboratory for experimental economic research (olew) in april and may 2024".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mvznnc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data set contains results (+ data dictionary) of the economic laboratory experiment about “algorithm aversion vs. loss aversion” as conducted in Ostfalia Laboratory for Experimental Economic Research (OLEW) in April and May 2024.".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mvznnc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-mvznnc".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mvznnc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
