<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ektpzz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FEKTPZZ>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ektpzz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: the role of non-equilibrium populations in dark exciton formation".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ektpzz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data Repository to create the datasets of \\'The role of non-equilibrium populations in dark exciton formation\\'. For usage see \\'readme.md\\'. Contents This Repository includes: - momipy version 0.6.0 - processed datasets - main evaluation to recreate main figures 1-4 and method figures 1-3 The authors do not take any responsibility of the correctness of the provided code and data. Use at your own risk. Last tested: 2026-03-26 using python version 3.11 using momipy version 0.6.0".
