<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ozl8nn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Mawan.et.al.2022_bmc.ecol.evol._environmental variables in efforts core plots 2013.csv".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ozl8nn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A set of Environmental Variables from EFForTS core plots in rainforest, jungle rubber, and monoculture plantations of rubber and oil palm, measured by various EFForTS workgroups in 2013. Those Environmantal Variables include, but are not limited to, ambient humidity and temperature, litterfall and abveground biomass, abundance and richness of plants in general and trees in particular, and indices of vegetational complexity and land use intensity.".
