<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-l9rhau> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-l9rhau> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/goettingen>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-l9rhau> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625/L9RHAU>.
