<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-whxx91> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The corresponding audio recordings to the high-speed videos where applicable. The microphone has a nominal frequency bandwidth up to 100kHz (Bruel&Kjaer 4135) and is amplified by 30dB. Along with the data comes the python-script to execute the fft and save an audible wav file.".
