<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ss1tyi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Geochemical compositions of igneous rocks of the central andean orocline".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ss1tyi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Compilation of more than 1500 major- and trace-element data points, and 650 Sr-, 610 Nd-, and 570 Pb-isotopic analyses of Mesozoic-Cenozoic (190–0 Ma) magmatic rocks in southern Peru, northern Chile and Bolivia (Central Andean orocline). This compilation was initially published by Mamani et al. (2010) and was based on selected data published up until 2009, combined with new data from that study.".
