<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ox5pvm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Learning assessment for literacy and numeracy skills in school-aged children".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ox5pvm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains data of a learning assessment conducted with school-aged children in 128 primary schools in Sokoto State, Nigeria, for the evaluation of the school development programme Nigerian Partnership for Education Project (NIPEP). It contains two survey waves, implemented in 2018 and 2019. The dataset contains codebook, raw data, questionnaires, and a manual for the learning assessment. The learning assessment has sections on literacy, numeracy captured in standard mathematics tasks, and a market simulation game.".
