<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-95wcn8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: population dynamics of manyara monkey cercopithecus mitis manyaraensis and vervet monkey chlorocebus pygerythrus in lake manyara national park, tanzania".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-95wcn8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains population densities and observed group sizes of primate species in Lake Manyara National Park, Tanzania. The first and second datasheets contain point estimates (\\'Density\\') and associated 95% confidence intervals (\\'lower\\'; \\'upper\\') of Manyara monkeys and vervet monkey. Densities were estimated for each season (LR=Long rains; Dry = Dry season; SR= Short rains) in the years 2011 to 2019. The group size datasheet contains data on the observed group sizes of each target species during the seasonal surveys.".
