<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1tjvme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data for publications \\'Heterogenitätsbewusste Digitale Gestaltung Eines Einführungsmoduls in Der Informatik\\' and \\'Cooperative Gamification in a Computer Science Introductory Module\\', referenced in chapter 5. Additional data used for chapter 6. Module evaluation data at the end of the semester: - Winter semester 2018/19 - from StudIP - Winter semester 2019/20 - from LimeSurvey - Winter semester 2020/21 - from LimeSurvey - Winter semester 2021/22 - from LimeSurvey Weekly evaluation data for Coding Classes for winter semester 2019/20 Written interview data with student tutors: - Winter semester 2019/20 - Winter semester 2020/21 - Winter semester 2021/22 Group interview protocol with selected student tutor on the basis of written interview from winter semester 2019/20 Algo-counter data from 10/19/2020 to 02/22/2021 (winter semester 2020/21)".
