<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-p7lnsb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "In this data set, you can find the relevant python scripts to replicate the data published in the master\\'s thesis: Numerical Simulations of a Stochastic Optimal Control Model for the Navigation of Finite-Size Microswimmers. Please read the readme.md before starting any simulation.".
