<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ezpkho> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The file contains data on the abundance of oribatid mites collected at three elevations (1000 m, 2000 m, and 3000 m) in a tropical mountain rainforest in Ecuador during 2009, 2011, and 2018. Environmental variables and species traits used in the analysis are also included in the spreadsheets.".
