<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kyvgyq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains interaction experimental data from optical trapping measurements. The dataset includes results for single vimentin filaments under various pulling velocity conditions. See supplementary material for the details of the experiments. The files are placed in designated figure folder, with an accompanying readme.txt to guide through the contents for each folder.".
