<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-c7edjh> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "B11 - efforts-bee bacteria 16s rrna amplicon dataset".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-c7edjh> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset comprises of bacterial taxonomy profiling data derived from the subplots of the B11 experiment. The samples were taken in April/May 2017. The tables show all detected taxonomic Units based on 16S rRNA (v3-v4) sequencing data. The rawdata was cleaned and mapped against the SILVA database for taxonomic classification.".
