<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-qafdum> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Ramos.2022.peerj_canopy.spiders.2013_bodysizes.biomass".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-qafdum> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Supporting information and raw data for biomass calculations of canopy spiders The file contains, in columns: Plot, Land Use, Average Body Length, average body width, individual body mass, abundance per plot, abundance per square meter, and total biomass per square meter.Abundances are based on subplots 1+2 per plot, excluding subplot 3.".
