<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-oxuhhc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Major and edxrf trace element chemical analyses of volcanic rocks from lassen volcanic national park and vicinity, california".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-oxuhhc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "WDXRF major-element chemical data for late Pliocene to Holocene volcanic rocks collected from Lassen Volcanic National Park and vicinity, California. Data for Rb, Sr, Ba, Y, Zr, Nb, Ni, Cr, Zn and Cu obtained by EDXRF are included for many samples. Published as USGS Open-File Report 2008-1091 (Clynne et al., 2008).".
