<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-vcjeqi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains replication files for the peer-reviewed journal article \\'Effects of a large-scale participatory learning and action programme in women’s groups on knowledge and behaviour related to pregnancy- and childcare: a cluster-randomized controlled trial in Bihar, India\\'. The dataset includes raw data, analysis data, and code files to replicate the analysis on the level of individual women.".
