<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Complete dataset on the implementation and validation of a 24/7 therapeutic drug monitoring (TDM) system for 26 antiepileptic drugs (AEDs).".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/goettingen>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ntqnu5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625/NTQNU5>.
