<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-pqdaeq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Senad1_jupyter_notebooks: project senad - machine learning-based degradation monitoring for asphalt road pavements".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-pqdaeq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A jupyter notebook to learn the road degradation state from the data set of the preliminary SenAD1 project. It is assumed that the data is located in a ‘data’ directory in the project directory. The jupyter notebool was created in the SenAD project (Sensorintegration in Asphalt für ein datenbasiertes Degradationsmonitoring/ Sensor integration in asphalt for data-based degradation monitoring) and can be used to interpret the data in https://doi.org/10.25625/R1CN7N.".
