<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-tsysgr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Urbanization and seasonal effects on dairy cow diets and milk quality in the indian megacity of bengaluru".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-tsysgr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> " Rampant urbanization reduces dairy feed production near Indian cities.  Farmers rely on food leftovers and lakeshore vegetation as alternative feed sources.  Changed diets impacts milk quality, especially the fatty acid profile.  Urban cows’ milk contains more beneficial fatty acids than peri-urban cows’ milk.".
