<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ap5brq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Dataset: retinal ganglion cell spike trains from axolotl, mouse, and marmoset for full-field stimulation".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ap5brq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Spike train data from axolotl, mouse, and marmoset retinal ganglion cells in response to temporally modulated full-field stimulation (white noise and chirp). Matlab code for reading the data and generating figures from the cited pre-print. See README file for further information.".
