<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ensorg> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Leo-III is an automated theorem prover for (polymorphic) higher-order logic which supports all common TPTP dialects, including THF, TFF and FOF as well as their rank-1 polymorphic derivatives. It is based on a paramodulation calculus.".
