<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FUW5RPL>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Growing_2020-nov".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Densities and traces of growing microtubule ends imaged in November 2020".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-uw5rpl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
