<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-vbyvad> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Experimental FTIR and Raman jet spectra of cyclohexanol are provided. The FTIR spectrum was recorded by Matthias Heger during his PhD at the Filet Jet Setup in the group of Prof. Martin A. Suhm. The FTIR spectrum is provided in the range of 4000-2900 cm-1. The Raman spectrum was recorded by Beppo Hartwig during his master\\'s thesis at the Curry jet setup in the group of Prof. Martin A. Suhm. The Raman spectrum is provided in the range of 3699-3241 cm-1.".
