<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ic16ao> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: the contribution of community-based conservation models to conserving large herbivore populations".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ic16ao> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains density estimates derived by line distance sampling surveys for elephant (Loxodonta africana), giraffe (Giraffa tippelskirchi), zebra (Equus quagga) and wildebeest (Connochaetes taurinus) across six management units (TNP: Tarangire National Park; LMNP: Lake Manyara National Park; BWMA: Burunge Wildlife Management Area; RWMA: Randilen Wildlife Management Area; MR: Manyara Ranch; MGCA: Mto wa Mbu Game Controlled Area) in the Tarangire Ecosystem, northern Tanzania. The Rcode allows replicating the analyses. Please refer to the Rcode for more instructions.".
