<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FKBE5OR>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Annette strauch-davey (2022). newsletter fdm_ubhildesheim - forschungsdatenmanagement. 03.01.2022".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "fdm_ubhildesheim Forschungsdatenmanagement".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-kbe5or".
