<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-0qkdpk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data Management Plan (DMP) for the SeedDiv project, describing data types, documentation standards, storage/backup, legal and ethical constraints, and archiving and sharing strategies (including EVA/ENA and GRO.data deposits). Gro.plan was used to create this DMP and questions are answering the questionaire of DFG catalogue without discipline-specific requirements for interdisciplinarity of underlying data described.".
