<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jgqetf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset provides information on reproductive traits (i.e., fecundity, egg size) as well as information on larval diet type and female body size for European butterflies and Erebidae moths (Insecta: Lepidoptera).".
