<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-19bzal> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Supplementary Material for Bruns, C., Bekas, V., Labisch, S. and Dirks, J.-H. (2025). Cuticular microstructure of the locust femur-tibia Joint. Open Biology. This data contains image stacks of CT-Scans of the femur-tibia joint in the mesothoracic leg of Locusta migratoria at different joint positions as well as STL files.".
