<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mgctrr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: the impact of a participatory learning and action intervention on unmet need for contraception: a cluster-randomized controlled trial in rural bihar, india".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mgctrr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains replication files for the peer-reviewed journal article \\'The Impact of a Participatory Learning and Action Intervention on Unmet Need for Contraception: A Cluster-Randomized Controlled Trial in Rural Bihar, India\\'. The dataset includes raw data, analysis data, and code files to replicate the analysis.".
