<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cm6tn5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: formal vs. informal mathematics: assessing numeracy with school and market items in a large sample of school-aged children in north-west nigeria".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cm6tn5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains replication data for the peer-reviewed article \\'Formal vs. informal mathematics: Assessing numeracy with school and market items in a large sample of school-aged children in North-West Nigeria\\'. The article assesses the skill gap between formal and informal mathematics in school-aged children in North-West Nigeria. The dataset includes raw data, analysis data, and code files to replicate the analysis.".
