<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-amnqc4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "LiveDocs on Optimal Transport. Link for the repository Link for the LiveDocs in Binderhub In this collection of 4 Jupyter notebooks, the reader is gently and informally introduced to selected topics of Optimal Transport and Particle Colocalization. The notebooks were written for intermediate Bachelor\\'s students in mathematics or Computer Science. The notebooks are written in Python 3 with Jupyter and ipywidgets as the interactive elements. They utilize numpy, scipy, and a library for solving optimal transport problems developed by Prof. Bernhard Schmitzer.".
