<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-alenoo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains the data, code, and results associated with our paper „Heterogeneous equity responses to forward guidance shocks: An asset pricing perspective“. USAGE ----- 1. Open the R scripts in Code/ and adjust the working directory paths if needed. Make sure to set the working directory to .../FGShocks/Data for the data inputs and .../FGShocks/Results for the outputs. 2. Run the scripts. Outputs will be saved automatically to Results/.".
