<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-hqulgy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The data set includes the genotypes of 13 EST-SSR loci for 399 samples of Taxus baccata individuals from Bavarian Forest National Park, Germany.".
