<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kmahi7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FKMAHI7>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kmahi7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Evaluation and development of prediction models for enteric methane emissions from cattle in india".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kmahi7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The following metadata is composed of mean values from 28 studies conducted between 2001 and 2023 in 13 different states of India. These data were put together for inclusion into the evaluation dataset for the study “Evaluation and development of prediction models for enteric methane emissions from cattle in India”. Further details on how the data was generated and cleaned can be found in the methodology section of the afore-mentioned study.".
