<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-eripbt> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FERIPBT>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-eripbt> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Tree species maps germany - observation counts".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-eripbt> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "These maps depict how many valid satellite observations were used at each location and year. Pixels that did not contain snow, any form of cloud or cloud shadow were counted as valid. Lower counts can be related to worse performance.".
