<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-f5kyut> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data used to generate the figures and perform statistical tests. In the table each line corresponds to one trial. Field: Description Participant: participant identifier Hit: cursor ended in target arc [0 or 1] Target_direction: direction of true target location in degrees Uncertainty: visual uncertainty level (0, 15, 30, 60, NaN [for VIB trials]) Cue: cue modality (VIS, VIS+VIB, VIB) Mid_reach_error: Absolute angular difference between target direction and cursor direction at half-eccentricity in degrees Mid_reach_angle: cursor direction at half-eccentricity in degrees Mt: movement time in ms Rt: reaction time in ms".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-f5kyut> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-f5kyut".
