<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-fv59s0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset will include specis lists, data tables and R scripts used for the statistical analysis of the article: Kirsch, F., Haß, A. L., Alfert, A. and Westphal, C. (2024): “Landscape diversity, habitat connectivity, age and size determine the conservation value of limestone quarries for diverse wild bee communities” (Journal of Applied Ecology).".
