<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-tkybek> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Experiment e43".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-tkybek> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Indentation simulations, where microspheres are pressed into layers of actomyosin networks. The myosin motors can dynamically bind, unbind and perform steps. Final states of cross-linked networks of E38 served as initial states, where cross-links were replaced by motors.".
