<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cvuepo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Cacao grafting increases crop yield without compromising biodiversity".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cvuepo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset includes all data tables and R scripts used in the data preparation and statistical analyses for the paper \\'Cacao grafting increases crop yield without compromising biodiversity\\' by Carolina Ocampo-Ariza, Sophie Müller, et al. Unfortunately, Gro.Data does not allowed for the files to be organized in subfolders. Therefore, readers who download this will have to rewrite the location of all files accordingly.".
