<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-0vovnj> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Perioperative laboratory profiles predict complications after extensive head and neck reconstruction: a proof-of-concept study".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-0vovnj> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset comprises the retrospective analysis of perioperative laboratory parameters from 233 patients with oral squamous cell carcinoma (OSCC) who underwent tumor resection and reconstructive head and neck surgery, including detailed laboratory histories, complication rates, and clinical parameters for the investigation of predictive markers of postoperative complications.".
