<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jlhl13> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The presentation is the result of DFG financed work, AZ NI 1250/1-2 Based on so called roadshow visits of 15 working groups across Germany and a online survey, both conducted in 2017, needs, gaps and challenges for research data management with respect to biological environmental research had been presented at the general assembly of the DFG financed GFBio project, gfbio.org.".
