<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-utt4sn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FUTT4SN>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-utt4sn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data for: comprehensive search filters for retrieving publications on non-human primates for literature reviews (filternhp)".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-utt4sn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset supports filterNHP, an R package and web-based application for generating search filters to query scientific bibliographic sources (PubMed, PsycINFO, Web of Science) for non-human primate related publications. filterNHP can be found at: https://filterNHP.dpz.eu.".
