<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-bvgmii> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Experimental pickett fits of the fluoroiodobenzenes".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-bvgmii> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide the experimental fit files, obtained with Pickett’s SPFIT/SPCAT (32-bit version) programs with Kisiel’s graphical interface AABS. PIFORM (version 31.XII.2016) was used for reformatting the fit output file. In all cases the Watson S reduction of the Hamiltonian in the Ir representation was employed. In case of iodobenzene, the data taken from O. Dorosh, E. Białkowska-Jaworska, Z. Kisiel and L. Pszczółkowski, J. Mol. Spectrosc., 2007, 246, 228–232 DOI: 10.1016/j.jms.2007.09.010 was refitted, as the original fit uses the Watson A reduction in the Ir representation. Additionally, QDIAG version 1a.I.1998 outputs are provided. The nomenclature follows Fig. 1 of the main publication which is also attached (nomenclature.pdf). All files provided are in an ASCII format.".
