<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-c3uvai> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Hydrate donor redshift anticipation (hydra) dataset".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-c3uvai> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The HyDRA (Hydrate Donor Redshift Anticipation) dataset. A tabulation of the hydrogen-bonded OH bond stretching fundamental of water in selected hydrated complexes relative to the free water value of 3657 cm-1 (experimental symmetric stretch). The data pertains to gas phase low temperature experiments.".
