<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-im01ea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication data for: on super-resolution holography".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-im01ea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Python implementation of the SRH algorithm as well as analysis scripts and experimental data for the paper \\'On Super-Resolution Holography\\'. The data has been collected during a synchrotron beamtime (Proposal No. II-20211052) at the coherence beamline P10, PETRA III, Deutsches Elektronen-Synchrotron DESY (Hamburg, Germany). Only the data used in the paper is published here.".
