<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cmqy0q> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FCMQY0Q>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cmqy0q> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data for: \\'primat: robust multi-animal tracking for primates in the wild\\'".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-cmqy0q> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Training images for tracking lemurs and macaques (500 each) with their respective labels, training images for identifying lemurs with labels. Validation and test video sequences for tracking lemurs and macaques (24 sequences x 12s for each species). Video output of our model and a DeepLabCut model on the validation sequences of the lemurs. Video output of our model for the macaques. Model weights for tracking and identification models.".
