<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mrij02> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625/MRIJ02>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mrij02> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:goe-doi-10-25625-mrij02.
