<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-9ltsmw> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Vegetation structure metrics were derived from mobile and airborne laser scanning at two different voxel sizes: 1 m and 0.5 m. The data were collected in 125 LA plots located in four land-cover types: forest, fallow land, rubber and oil palm. The metrics cover information on structural complexity, canopy heterogeneity, vertical structure and gap structure.".
