<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-qji8jn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FQJI8JN>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-qji8jn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Primary school characteristics in sokoto state, nigeria".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-qji8jn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains data collected in 128 primary schools in Sokoto State, Nigeria, for the evaluation of the school development programme Nigerian Partnership for Education Project (NIPEP). It contains two survey waves (2018 and 2019), each containing four survey tools implemented during unannounced visits to schools: an observational survey of the school, and interviews with the headmaster, teachers, and members of a school-based management committee. The dataset contains codebook, raw data, and questionnaires.".
