<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-mvuijq> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains supplementary datasets for the publication titled \\'Inherited Grain-size Distributions: Effect on Heavy-mineral Assemblages in Modern and Ancient Sediments\\'".
