<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-4isiq9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The data are stored in zipped folders according to the measurement buffer. The raw data are in hdf5 format, including the optical trap meta data. Folders include a read_me text file.".
