<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-evx6vk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Metabarcoding reads of canopy arthropods, sampled with flight interception traps for four weeks between June and July 2022 in the Solling forest, Lower Saxony, Germany. Includes the raw fastq files and an overview table after initial bioinformatic analyses.".
