<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ks6njw> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Altersverteilung des wissenschaftlichen Personals 1974".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ks6njw> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-ks6njw".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ks6njw> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
