<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-nfiknj> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Xyz structure files of dimers of transiently chiral alcohols and (a)chiral hydroxy esters".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-nfiknj> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide xyz structure files at the B3LYP-D3(BJ,abc)/def2-TZVP level of computation for the following dimers: - benzyl alcohol + methyl (S)-(-)-lactate: most stable homochiral (gauche(-) benzyl alchohol) / heterochiral (gauche(+) benzyl alcohol) inserted and most stable homochiral / heterochiral associated - benzyl alcohol + methyl glycolate: most stable inserted and associated - 4-chlorobenzyl alcohol + methyl (S)-(-)-lactate: most stable homochiral / heterochiral inserted and most stable homochiral / heterochiral associated - 4-chlorobenzyl alcohol + methyl glycolate: most stable inserted and associated".
