<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-9vr9wt> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the python scripts to replicate the numerical examples presented in the paper \\'Robust finite element discretizations for a simplified Galbrun\\'s equation\\'. A running installation of NGSolve is needed to run the code. For a full list of requirements, and the specific versions used, see the included requirements.txt file.".
