<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-yxhc63> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.2c02906 Marina Bennati JoAnne Stubbe Andreas Meyer Annemarie Kehl Fehmke Anna Katharina Reichardt Fabian Hecker Kuan-Ting Pan Lisa-Marie Funk Chang Cui Kai Tittmann Henning Urlaub".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-yxhc63> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-yxhc63".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-yxhc63> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-yxhc63> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/goettingen>.
