<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ksiu6u> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Replication data for an extraction artefact comprising a page-level dataset, an automated evaluation pipeline, model and text-preprocessing comparisons, and iterative prompt and few-shot refinement. Pages from sustainability reports can be processed directly by VLMs to preserve visual–textual structure.".
