<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ycyveb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data and script for the Figure 5 contain the following: - The COMSOL-model of the oocyte and its nucleus - Two folders that contain the contours of the cell & nucleus after deformation - Python file that reads in the simulation data and creates Figure 5".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-ycyveb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-ycyveb".
