<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-y03yd4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Hpa axis activity of assamese macaques".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-y03yd4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This database contains the data used to estimated HPA axis activity in wild Assamese macaques. The datasets support the research paper: \\'Early prenatal but not postnatal glucocorticoid exposure is associated with enhanced HPA axis activity into adulthood in a wild primate \\'.".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-y03yd4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-y03yd4".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-y03yd4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
