<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-8nnkmd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Uav laser scanning data (leaf-on 2025)".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-8nnkmd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Source: FoResLab SP: 07 Status: completed Type: Lidar Point Cloud Point density: >1000pts/sqm Data format: LAS 1.4 format 7 (.laz) Date of acquisition: Juli to September 2025 Short description: lidar pointcloud acquired with DJI Zenmuse L1 sensor on board a DJI M350 RTK drone. Flights were conducted in 80-90m AGL with ~5m/s. Spatial extent: 50x50m plots extent with a 5 meter buffer Final metric table of box-dimension, canopy cover, effective number of layers, foliage height diversity and vertical evenness.".
