<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-bp0dpy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the trafofem package and python scripts to replicate the numerical examples presented in the paper. The trafofem package is an extension for NGSolve which can be used to assemble bilinear forms that contain geometric transformations. Further information is available in the included README.md and requirements.txt files.".
