<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-th5kex> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ALS-derived metrics used in the manuscript \\'Using Airborne Laser Scanning to characterize land-use systems in a tropical landscape based on vegetation structural metrics\\'".
