<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-680zpm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Microsatellite and genome-wide SNP genotypes for 500 European beech individuals from five populations located in the Romanian Carpathians, near the city of Brașov. The data sets were generated for a scientific publication (10.21203/rs.3.rs-4559673/v1). They support the analysis of genetic variation, population structure and fine-scale spatial genetic structure.".
