<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-pcxqqz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Repository of supplementary materials linked to the PhD thesis \\'Application of Machine Learning Techniques to the N-particle Expansion\\', containing curated datasets, benchmark calculations, input and output files, that support the development and validation of machine learning methods in quantum chemistry. These resources are organised by chapter to facilitate reuse and reproducibility.".
