<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1vofm5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2F1VOFM5>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1vofm5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Georoc compilation: complex volcanic settings".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-1vofm5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Compilation of geochemical and isotopic rock compositions from complex volcanic settings held in the GEOROC database. Results are grouped by geographical region. Files were generated from the GEOROC database on 2026-06-01.".
