<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-awzcsf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The data provides the R-script to replicate the results of Isenhardt et al. (2023) “Tenant Favoritism and Right of First Refusals in Farmland Auctions: Competition and Price Effects”.".
