<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gj6xur> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-v7htb8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-v7htb8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FV7HTB8>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-v7htb8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Generalisation tagger cv models".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-v7htb8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "These models were downloaded from https://gitlab.gwdg.de/tillmann.doenicke/thesis/-/tree/v1.0/deep_learning/models/cv. Version 1.0 contains the multi-class and the binary model. Version 2.0 contains only the multi-class model (that should be used for binary tagging as well).".
