<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FJXFOPE>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Strauch-davey, annette, 2022, annette strauch-davey (2022). newsletter fdm_ubhildesheim - forschungsdatenmanagement. 25.11.2021".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Newsletter".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-jxfope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
