<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-67ot6p> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Replication data set for the publication: Rahrt, R.; Koszinowski, K. C versus O Protonation in Zincate Anions: A Simple Gas-Phase Model for the Surprising Kinetic Stability of Organometallics, Chem. Eur. J. 2023, e202203611. For detailed information about the file and data structure, see README.txt.".
