<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kwtio8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Meta data for: \\'modular architecture facilitates noise-driven control of synchrony in neuronal networks\\'".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-kwtio8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Meta Data for our publication. The data includes calcium activity recordings from neuronal cultures and matching simulations, stored on an open research data platform (G-Node GIN) together with a description of how to use the data. The corresponding source code for analysis is accessible from Zenodo and Github.".
