<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-aidfg2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Raster models of NDVI over the PTPN 6 estate (Area 1), Batanghari regency (Area 2), Harapan rainforest protected area (Area 3), and Sarolangun regency (Area 4), in Jambi, Sumatra, Indonesia. Pixel size: 1m. Geographic Coordinate System: EPSG 32748.".
