<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2FGMDDDY>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Forest outcomes in indonesia at the district level (2001-2022)".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Yearly forest outcomes between 2001-2022 for Indonesian districts, including yearly forest losses and initial forest cover. Based on Hansen\\'s (2013) Global Forest Cover data set.".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-gmdddy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
