<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-fp7p6k> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Datasets including all functional traits and all vulnerability curve data measured on rubber trees in Harapan landscape in the framework of CRC 990 EFForTS. Data where collected in 2017 and 2018 by group B04".
