<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-237cij> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25625%2F237CIJ>.
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-237cij> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Strategic selection of polliniser trees can improve fruit quality".
<http://localhost:5002/goe-doi-10-25625-237cij> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We identified flower visitors and determined dependence on cross-pollination in a commercial, Australian lychee orchard. We assessed the effects of pollen parentage on fruit quality. This research was conducted in 2020 - 2021, and is part of project PH16001 of the Hort Frontiers strategic partnership initiative developed by Hort Innovation Australia.".
